# Accented letters are accents: typed plain, they are restored (chat is
# often typed without them).

# find-supplement.py: there is little text in this language (Common Voice
# and Tatoeba together under 0.3 MB), so a word form seen this many times in
# both together is enough, as for fi.
one-source 3

# Word forms the list lacks (dictionary.h: isWordForm): typed, they stand;
# they are never suggested. The list (Sloleks, data/sloleks/) has most
# forms; these cover the rarer ones below its cut-off: uporablja →
# uporabljam, uporabljaš, uporabljamo, uporabljate, uporabljava,
# uporabljata, uporabljajo; najde → najdem, najdeš… Imperatives: sodeluj →
# sodelujte, sodelujmo.
suffix m š mo te va ta jo after=aei
suffix te mo after=j
